
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Wens 254 Rentals | Find Your Home</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Find quality, affordable rental homes with Wens 254 Rentals in Kenya.">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f8fa;
      color: #17212b;
    }
    header {
      background: #102d27;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 7%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 800; }
    .logo span { color: #e9b65a; }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 440px;
      padding: 90px 8%;
      color: white;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #102d27ed, #102d2760),
      url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?w=1600") center/cover;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(35px, 6vw, 58px); max-width: 650px; }
    .hero p { margin: 20px 0; font-size: 18px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e9b65a;
      color: #17212b;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      width: fit-content;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    section { padding: 65px 7%; }
    .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 35px; }
    .section-title h2 { font-size: 30px; }
    .section-title p { color: #68727b; margin-top: 10px; }
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #0000000c;
    }
    .card img { width: 100%; height: 210px; object-fit: cover; }
    .card-content { padding: 22px; }
    .card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .price { color: #167653; font-weight: bold; margin: 12px 0; }
    .about {
      background: #eaf0ed;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .about p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 15px auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #53605b;
    }
    .contact {
      background: #102d27;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .contact p { margin: 15px 0 25px; }
    footer {
      background: #091e19;
      color: #bdc9c3;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 22px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    @media(max-width:600px) {
      header { justify-content: center; }
      nav a { margin: 0 7px; }
      .hero { padding: 65px 7%; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">WENS <span>254</span> RENTALS</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#properties">Properties</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="hero" id="home">
    <h1>Find a Place You'll Love to Call Home.</h1>
    <p>Affordable, comfortable and convenient rental homes in Kenya.</p>
    <a href="#properties" class="btn">Explore Properties</a>
  </div>

  <section id="properties">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Our Properties</h2>
      <p>Discover comfortable places to call home.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554995207-c18c203602cb?w=800" alt="Modern rental room">
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3>Affordable Single Rooms</h3>
          <p>Comfortable living spaces in Kamulu.</p>
          <div class="price">KSh 4,500 / month</div>
          <a class="btn" href="#contact">Enquire Now</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?w=800" alt="Modern apartment">
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3>Quality Rental Homes</h3>
          <p>Explore our available accommodation.</p>
          <div class="price">Contact us for pricing</div>
          <a class="btn" href="#contact">Enquire Now</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>About Wens 254 Rentals</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      We are committed to providing affordable and comfortable
      rental accommodation. Our goal is to make finding and
      managing your next home simple and convenient.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2>Looking for Your Next Home?</h2>
    <p>Contact Wens 254 Rentals today.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/254700000000">
      Contact Us on WhatsApp
    </a>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 Wens 254 Rentals. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
